WEBVTT

00:10.030 --> 00:11.850
Th-This is...

00:11.850 --> 00:15.360
It's the black tiger I told you 
I defeated last time.

00:15.360 --> 00:18.080
I'm hoping you can harvest the parts for me.

00:19.400 --> 00:20.830
Well...

00:20.830 --> 00:23.380
Not possible?

00:23.380 --> 00:27.570
No, I think I can, since Dad 
said that wolves and black tigers

00:27.570 --> 00:31.550
are harvested the same way.

00:31.550 --> 00:34.330
But I might not be able to 
because of a different reason...

00:34.330 --> 00:35.760
A different reason?

00:35.760 --> 00:37.850
Let me try.

00:40.340 --> 00:41.880
So hard!

00:43.110 --> 00:48.500
Like I thought, its fur is 
too tough for my iron knife.

02:23.850 --> 02:28.510
Yuna Sis, I can't harvest this black tiger.

02:28.510 --> 02:30.540
I think you should ask my dad to do it.

02:32.030 --> 02:33.000
Leave it to me!

02:33.510 --> 02:34.680
Hold up.

02:34.680 --> 02:37.230
If an iron knife doesn't work,

02:37.230 --> 02:40.770
does that mean you could do it 
if you had a better knife?

02:40.770 --> 02:41.840
Yeah, probably...

02:43.990 --> 02:45.880
Then let's go buy a new knife.

02:45.880 --> 02:48.100
Where do they sell knives?

02:48.100 --> 02:51.900
I think we can probably buy one from 
Mrs. Nelt and Mr. Gold's blacksmith shop.

02:51.900 --> 02:55.610
Oh! That dwarven smithy.

02:57.300 --> 02:58.840
Excuse us!

02:58.840 --> 03:02.930
Welcome, Miss Bear! And Fina, too!

03:02.930 --> 03:04.330
Hello.

03:04.330 --> 03:10.000
Miss Bear, I've been hearing a lot about you
from our adventuring regulars.

03:10.000 --> 03:13.010
Hunting black vipers and 
starting up businesses?

03:14.460 --> 03:15.890
What brings you here today?

03:15.890 --> 03:19.160
Want to buy a weapon? Or you 
need some maintenance done?

03:19.160 --> 03:23.010
I have a monster that can't be
 harvested with an iron knife.

03:23.010 --> 03:25.310
What're you trying to harvest?

03:25.310 --> 03:27.890
No way... Maybe a dragon?!

03:29.590 --> 03:31.490
It's a black tiger.

03:33.750 --> 03:36.830
You've taken down a pretty crazy monster.

03:36.830 --> 03:39.100
There's no way an iron knife 
would work on something like that.

03:39.100 --> 03:42.610
You'd need a steel or mithril knife for that.

03:42.610 --> 03:44.070
Mithril?!

03:44.400 --> 03:46.170
By mithril...

03:46.170 --> 03:50.130
You mean the ultimate material 
often found in fantasy games?!

03:50.130 --> 03:52.710
This world has mithril!

03:52.710 --> 03:55.920
Mithril equipment is the dream of all gamers!

03:55.920 --> 03:57.130
I want it!

03:57.540 --> 03:59.260
I'd like to buy a mithril knife!

03:59.260 --> 04:01.090
Do you sell mithril swords, too?

04:01.090 --> 04:02.930
If you do, I want it!

04:02.930 --> 04:06.380
Yuna Sis, mithril knives are expensive.

04:06.380 --> 04:07.760
A steel knife will work just fine.

04:07.760 --> 04:11.020
No! We should think about the future!

04:11.020 --> 04:15.100
Yuna Sis, what kind of monsters are 
you planning on having me harvest?

04:15.100 --> 04:18.830
Sorry to burst your bubble, but we don't 
have any mithril in stock right now.

04:18.830 --> 04:21.100
What?! I see...

04:21.100 --> 04:23.820
Well, you'll be able to harvest 
a black tiger with a steel knife, too.

04:24.680 --> 04:28.420
No! I have to have a mithril knife!

04:30.870 --> 04:33.620
<i>I want Fina to have the best equipment.</i>

04:33.940 --> 04:37.790
<i>Most importantly, mithril has 
ignited my spirit as a gamer!</i>

04:37.790 --> 04:41.260
I can't settle for anything less 
after hearing there's mithril!

04:42.630 --> 04:47.400
Well, it's hard to get your hands 
on mithril in town right now.

04:47.400 --> 04:49.260
Huh? Why?

04:49.260 --> 04:53.730
Seems like there's a problem with the mine, 
so we can't get any ore right now.

04:54.150 --> 04:59.060
We can still get other ores and 
steel, but mithril is pretty rare

04:59.460 --> 05:02.970
so I don't think there are any 
shops in Crimonia with any left.

05:02.970 --> 05:04.500
I see...

05:04.500 --> 05:08.990
Also, there aren't many blacksmiths 
that can work with mithril.

05:08.990 --> 05:13.370
My husband's probably the only one 
in Crimonia that can process it properly.

05:14.630 --> 05:16.330
Is there any mithril anywhere else?

05:16.330 --> 05:21.380
Well, the royal capital 
might still have some left.

05:21.380 --> 05:23.710
Then, I'll pop into 
the royal capital really quick.

05:23.710 --> 05:25.980
Huh? You plan to travel that far?

05:25.980 --> 05:26.930
Yeah.

05:26.930 --> 05:29.140
<i>It'll be super fast if I use the transfer gate.</i>

05:29.140 --> 05:31.890
I see. If that's the case...

05:32.520 --> 05:37.110
Hey! Dear! Quit sleeping and get up!

05:37.870 --> 05:39.610
Ouch...

05:39.610 --> 05:40.850
We have customers!

05:40.850 --> 05:43.260
No need to kick me!

05:47.890 --> 05:51.350
Oh, it's Fina and Miss Bear.

05:51.350 --> 05:53.110
H-Hello.

05:53.110 --> 05:57.340
These kids plan to go to the royal 
capital to buy a mithril knife.

05:57.340 --> 05:59.080
Introduce them to Ghazal!

05:59.500 --> 06:00.590
Ghazal?

06:00.590 --> 06:03.920
Yeah, he's a dwarf who lives
in the royal capital.

06:03.920 --> 06:07.630
I'll write you a letter of introduction, 
so stop by his smithy.

06:08.060 --> 06:10.590
He should be able to pull a few strings.

06:10.930 --> 06:16.100
<b>Bear, Seeking Mithril</b>

06:10.930 --> 06:16.100
<b>Bear, Seeking Mithril</b>

06:11.100 --> 06:13.980
We really came to the royal capital.

06:13.980 --> 06:17.290
Yuna Sis, we don't have to go this far...

06:17.290 --> 06:18.970
No! We do!

06:18.970 --> 06:20.160
Now, let's go!

06:21.130 --> 06:25.480
Let's see. Where's the blacksmith 
that Mr. Gold and Mrs. Nelt knows?

06:25.480 --> 06:27.950
They gave me directions to his smithy.

06:30.610 --> 06:32.860
The royal capital is too big.

06:32.860 --> 06:36.280
Um, maybe that way?

06:36.730 --> 06:38.080
Miss Yuna!

06:38.590 --> 06:41.130
Shia! Everyone!

06:41.130 --> 06:44.390
Lady Shia! It has been a while.

06:44.390 --> 06:47.840
Hello, Fina. Why are 
the two of you in the capital?

06:47.840 --> 06:49.930
We have a small errand to run.

06:51.010 --> 06:53.670
Where'd you get that bruise, Maricks?

06:53.670 --> 06:58.250
My father got a little upset about how 
I acted during the hands-on training.

06:58.250 --> 07:00.260
So he punched you.

07:00.850 --> 07:02.730
Isn't that a little harsh?

07:02.730 --> 07:04.470
It's true that I behaved terribly.

07:05.020 --> 07:07.860
But it doesn't really 
hurt anymore, so it's fine.

07:07.860 --> 07:11.350
Yeah, right. You freaked out 
when I touched it.

07:11.350 --> 07:13.570
I saw your eyes tearing up.

07:13.570 --> 07:17.720
It hurt because you touched me 
the day after I was punched!

07:17.720 --> 07:20.370
Are you all on your way 
home from the academy?

07:20.370 --> 07:26.300
Classes finished early today, so we 
all hunted monsters in a nearby forest.

07:26.300 --> 07:29.810
We all registered at the adventurer's guild.

07:29.810 --> 07:31.650
To gain more experience.

07:31.650 --> 07:35.050
We don't want to be as helpless as we 
were when you fought the black tiger.

07:35.050 --> 07:38.220
I see. You guys have been working hard.

07:39.830 --> 07:44.120
You came to the royal capital 
just to buy Fina a knife?!

07:44.120 --> 07:47.210
I told her that a steel knife would be fine...

07:47.210 --> 07:51.630
No, I've already decided 
on having Fina use a mithril knife!

07:53.930 --> 07:56.490
<i>She's so obsessed with mithril...</i>

07:57.010 --> 08:00.040
<i>Just like I thought, someday Yuna Sis will...</i>

08:02.640 --> 08:06.420
Please harvest these monsters!

08:06.420 --> 08:08.880
What?!

08:09.320 --> 08:10.840
<i>It's definitely going to happen!</i>

08:10.840 --> 08:13.930
Mithril! Mithril!

08:15.380 --> 08:16.680
Yuna Sis!

08:16.970 --> 08:18.680
Now that I have the best equipment,

08:18.680 --> 08:21.950
my harvesting skills have 
finally reached their peak!

08:35.980 --> 08:37.270
Watch!

08:40.230 --> 08:44.500
<i>My party should always 
have the best equipment.</i>

08:45.160 --> 08:47.830
That's what it means to be a gamer!

08:48.730 --> 08:50.510
<i>I knew it!</i>

08:50.510 --> 08:53.260
Ghazal's smithy should be around here.

08:55.550 --> 08:58.550
Thanks, everyone. I'll treat you 
to something next time.

08:58.550 --> 09:01.810
A treat? Then...

09:01.810 --> 09:03.560
Fluffy!

09:03.760 --> 09:05.310
Fluffy!

09:05.640 --> 09:08.020
Fluffy!

09:08.020 --> 09:09.660
Looks like they're having fun.

09:09.660 --> 09:11.750
Do they really feel that good?

09:11.750 --> 09:12.950
Wanna try holding them?

09:12.950 --> 09:14.360
No, it's okay!

09:14.360 --> 09:17.170
Bears are the best!

09:17.170 --> 09:19.450
They were so fluffy!

09:21.070 --> 09:22.240
Welp, let's go!

09:22.700 --> 09:25.700
We have to get our hands on a mithril knife!

09:25.700 --> 09:28.520
<i>Yuna Sis is so enthusiastic about this.</i>

09:29.590 --> 09:31.110
Excuse us!

09:31.450 --> 09:33.720
Is anyone here?

09:39.430 --> 09:41.100
A customer?

09:41.100 --> 09:42.790
Are you Mr. Ghazal?

09:42.790 --> 09:45.180
That's right. Who are you?

09:45.180 --> 09:47.160
That's a peculiar look.

09:47.160 --> 09:49.800
That's the first time someone 
described me as peculiar.

09:49.800 --> 09:52.550
Please don't mind how I'm dressed.

09:52.550 --> 09:56.680
More importantly, I have a letter 
from Mr. Gold in Crimonia.

09:59.980 --> 10:02.960
I understand, but it's impossible.

10:03.490 --> 10:06.700
There's a shortage of mithril ore 
in the royal capital, too.

10:06.700 --> 10:08.090
Even here?!

10:08.090 --> 10:12.460
Yeah, no one can extract mithril from the mine.

10:12.460 --> 10:15.430
I'd love to make you a knife 
since Gold referred you,

10:15.430 --> 10:17.860
but I don't have any mithril either.

10:17.860 --> 10:20.510
What's wrong with the mine?

10:20.510 --> 10:24.220
A lot of golems started 
coming out of the caves.

10:24.220 --> 10:28.260
Ask the adventurer's guild if you 
want to know the details about it.

10:30.560 --> 10:32.980
<i>Now it's the adventurer's guild?</i>

10:33.520 --> 10:36.020
Yuna Sis, let's get a steel...

10:36.020 --> 10:37.490
It's gotta be mithril!

10:37.490 --> 10:40.890
People need to work hard to obtain 
what they want when they want it!

10:40.890 --> 10:45.710
And the harder it is to get my 
hands on it, the more I want it!

10:46.330 --> 10:47.930
Wait, what?

10:47.930 --> 10:49.160
What in the world?

10:49.160 --> 10:51.270
A bear and a kid just came in!

10:51.270 --> 10:52.510
How cute.

10:52.510 --> 10:54.880
Someone take down that bear!

10:56.540 --> 10:57.970
Yuna Sis...

10:57.970 --> 10:58.920
Hey, now.

10:58.920 --> 11:03.210
This ain't a place for a kid and their pet.

11:03.210 --> 11:04.610
Go on home!

11:07.310 --> 11:08.910
Yuna Sis!

11:08.910 --> 11:12.850
Don't touch Fina with your dirty hands.

11:12.850 --> 11:14.820
What'd you say, Bear Girl?

11:14.820 --> 11:16.230
You got a complaint?

11:16.230 --> 11:18.110
Huh? What?

11:18.110 --> 11:20.280
Ow! Ow! Ow!

11:24.950 --> 11:27.230
What the hell did you do?!

11:27.230 --> 11:29.790
I just grabbed his hand and pulled.

11:29.790 --> 11:32.790
Who are you kidding?! Don't think 
you'll get away with this!

11:36.620 --> 11:37.580
Huh?

11:37.580 --> 11:39.560
What? A girl that small?

11:37.580 --> 11:39.730
What's going on here?!

11:39.560 --> 11:40.990
Scary!

11:39.730 --> 11:41.340
No fighting is allowed on guild grounds!

11:41.340 --> 11:44.680
Guild Master?! No, this is... Uh...

11:44.680 --> 11:46.510
<i>Huh? This person is...</i>

11:48.840 --> 11:50.980
Oh, aren't you Yuna?

11:51.340 --> 11:53.650
Do you know her, Yuna Sis?

11:53.650 --> 11:57.690
Yeah. I met her in the castle when 
I visited the royal capital before.

11:57.690 --> 12:00.510
This is the first time we've 
formally talked to each other.

12:00.510 --> 12:04.330
My name is Sanya. I'm the guild master here.

12:05.210 --> 12:07.560
You shouldn't lay your hands on this girl.

12:07.560 --> 12:10.040
Even if you ganged up on her, 
you wouldn't be able to handle her.

12:12.010 --> 12:13.310
O-Our apologies!

12:13.310 --> 12:14.350
Hey, let's go!

12:15.110 --> 12:17.410
Don't forget to take care 
of the one outside, too!

12:17.410 --> 12:18.400
Yes!

12:18.780 --> 12:20.730
Sorry about that, Yuna.

12:20.730 --> 12:22.860
What brings you here today?

12:22.860 --> 12:25.860
I wanted to find out about the mine.

12:25.860 --> 12:28.200
Oh, that problem...

12:28.200 --> 12:31.180
Huh? Yuna and Fina?

12:31.180 --> 12:33.410
Why are you two here?

12:33.410 --> 12:34.870
Lady Ellalaura?!

12:34.870 --> 12:38.180
I'd like to ask you the 
same thing, Mrs. Ellalaura.

12:38.180 --> 12:43.040
I have some business 
with Sanya about a mine.

12:43.900 --> 12:47.920
We already dispatched 
adventurers to the mine,

12:47.920 --> 12:51.240
but there were more golems than expected.

12:51.240 --> 12:53.000
There are a lot of them, aren't there?

12:53.000 --> 12:54.270
Yes.

12:54.270 --> 12:59.960
We currently don't have a clear number 
of how many are in the mine.

13:00.490 --> 13:04.170
On top of that, an especially 
strong golem appeared amongst them.

13:04.170 --> 13:06.050
I see.

13:06.050 --> 13:11.140
There may be a need to dispatch 
soldiers or knights from the castle.

13:11.530 --> 13:17.890
Currently, we have two capable parties 
from our guild hunting the golems.

13:17.890 --> 13:19.230
Just two parties?

13:19.580 --> 13:24.110
Skilled adventurers only take 
quests that they're interested in.

13:24.650 --> 13:26.950
There aren't many willing to take the job.

13:27.300 --> 13:30.530
Yuna Sis, why don't we give up and go home?

13:31.150 --> 13:37.270
Mrs. Ellalaura, Ms. Sanya, 
can I accept this quest, too?

13:37.270 --> 13:40.040
Huh? You can, but...

13:40.040 --> 13:43.140
That would be an immense help to 
the adventurer's guild, too.

13:43.140 --> 13:43.800
Are you sure?

13:43.800 --> 13:46.410
Yeah! I'll head over there right now.

13:46.410 --> 13:47.010
Huh?

13:47.010 --> 13:48.830
Thank you, Yuna!

13:48.830 --> 13:52.970
Then we'll take care of Fina at 
the Foschurose house while you're working.

13:52.970 --> 13:55.940
It wouldn't be good to take her with you.

13:55.940 --> 13:57.420
Huh?!

14:05.650 --> 14:08.260
My hero!

14:08.260 --> 14:10.190
Princess!

14:12.760 --> 14:17.100
You'll have to eliminate all the golems 
if you ever want your princess back!

14:18.200 --> 14:22.540
We'll be sure to take <i>really good</i> 
care of her while you're at it!

14:23.210 --> 14:25.170
To be precise,

14:25.480 --> 14:29.770
we'll fill her to the brim with 
delicious food and sweet snacks!

14:29.770 --> 14:35.930
And we'll shackle this delicate body of hers
with cute clothes and pretty accessories!

14:36.520 --> 14:41.310
My hero! Please save me!

14:41.310 --> 14:45.140
You witches! Princess, wait for me!

14:45.140 --> 14:48.800
I'll definitely defeat the golems 
and come back for you!

14:49.160 --> 14:50.360
Just kidding.

14:52.200 --> 14:55.010
Is that the mine?

14:55.010 --> 14:57.390
Welp, let's go.

15:00.000 --> 15:04.280
<i>I always get the same exaggerated reactions 
when I first come to a new town.</i>

15:04.280 --> 15:07.340
<i>That I'm a bear. Or my clothes are weird.</i>

15:07.340 --> 15:10.430
<i>That I'm a bear. That I'm a bear.</i>

15:10.430 --> 15:11.930
<i>That I'm a bear...</i>

15:15.300 --> 15:16.100
<i>Huh?</i>

15:16.630 --> 15:19.060
<i>I feel like I'm in Mileela all over again.</i>

15:19.380 --> 15:21.790
<i>There's no feeling of life in this town...</i>

15:21.790 --> 15:24.220
<i>Is it because the mine has been shut down?</i>

15:24.220 --> 15:25.460
Yuna?

15:25.460 --> 15:26.110
Huh?

15:26.480 --> 15:28.390
It really is you.

15:28.390 --> 15:31.910
Mr. Jaden and Ms. Mel, right?

15:31.910 --> 15:32.990
Yeah.

15:33.440 --> 15:34.930
Who are the other two?

15:34.930 --> 15:36.550
They're our party members.

15:36.550 --> 15:40.320
I've heard rumors about you. 
I'm the swordsman, Toya.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.540
I'm Senia.

15:42.070 --> 15:45.000
<i>He kinda seems like a player.</i>

15:45.000 --> 15:47.960
<i>This one seems like a cool beauty.</i>

15:47.960 --> 15:50.060
Why are you here, Yuna?

15:50.060 --> 15:51.910
Work, I guess.

15:51.910 --> 15:55.240
Are you also planning to hunt golems?

15:55.240 --> 15:57.590
Also? Are you guys hunting them, too?

15:57.590 --> 16:00.310
Yeah, we received a request from the guild.

16:00.310 --> 16:03.020
We were on our way back 
from another day of work.

16:03.020 --> 16:08.270
<i>Mr. Jaden's party must be one 
of the golem hunting parties</i>

16:08.270 --> 16:10.740
<i>Ms. Sanya was talking about.</i>

16:10.740 --> 16:12.410
How are things going?

16:12.410 --> 16:15.410
Did you finish them off yet?

16:15.410 --> 16:18.540
No, not yet.

16:19.070 --> 16:21.000
There are just too many golems.

16:21.000 --> 16:24.110
The numbers don't go down 
no matter how many we defeat.

16:24.110 --> 16:29.650
Though it seems they'll stop 
multiplying after a certain point.

16:29.650 --> 16:31.580
Why're things like that?

16:31.580 --> 16:37.140
I don't know, but I think 
it has something to do

16:37.140 --> 16:40.580
with the unknown golem at 
the very end of the cave.

16:42.480 --> 16:48.300
That golem was sighted around the same 
time this whole problem started.

16:53.990 --> 16:55.820
There's a hollow cavity?

16:56.530 --> 16:59.530
Hey! There's something there...

17:04.990 --> 17:09.670
After that, the golems 
started appearing in the mines.

17:10.290 --> 17:12.110
That's pretty suspicious.

17:12.630 --> 17:14.980
Why don't you go hunt down that golem?

17:14.980 --> 17:17.310
It's not that easy!

17:17.310 --> 17:21.630
The golems get stronger 
the deeper you go into the cave!

17:21.630 --> 17:26.780
The iron golem right before the deepest 
room is especially hard to handle.

17:26.780 --> 17:30.750
Well, if we can defeat it, 
the parts will sell for a pretty penny.

17:30.750 --> 17:34.890
<i>Iron golem... Is it a golem 
made completely of iron?</i>

17:34.890 --> 17:40.080
<i>My attacks will be limited inside a cave, 
so it sounds like a lot of trouble.</i>

17:41.370 --> 17:44.290
Are you sure you should be 
telling me all this information?

17:44.630 --> 17:46.460
It's an emergency.

17:46.460 --> 17:51.220
The guild is pushing us, and we want to 
finish things up as soon as possible.

17:51.220 --> 17:54.990
The mine being shut down is also causing 
a lot of trouble for the townspeople.

17:55.380 --> 17:58.240
It'll be great if you help, Yuna.

17:58.890 --> 18:01.950
<i>It's true that the town is pretty lifeless.</i>

18:01.950 --> 18:04.040
<i>Everyone looked so depressed.</i>

18:04.700 --> 18:08.190
Thanks for all the info. It helped a lot.

18:08.990 --> 18:10.540
Hey, hey. Yuna!

18:10.540 --> 18:14.360
It's pretty late. Have you 
decided where you'll stay?

18:14.360 --> 18:15.500
Not yet...

18:15.500 --> 18:18.110
Then come sleep in our room!

18:18.110 --> 18:20.580
Our room is for two.

18:20.580 --> 18:24.300
Who cares? I'll sleep in the same bed as Yuna!

18:24.300 --> 18:28.150
Yuna is small, so we'll be able to sleep 
together if she takes off her bear suit.

18:28.150 --> 18:29.310
I'm not taking it off.

18:29.310 --> 18:32.690
Why?! You don't want to sleep with me?!

18:33.130 --> 18:37.190
No. And I need to wear 
this suit to protect myself.

18:37.190 --> 18:38.300
What does that even mean?!

18:38.300 --> 18:41.830
I'm sure there are extra rooms in this inn.

18:41.830 --> 18:43.510
The innkeeper said so herself.

18:44.190 --> 18:45.700
Why'd you tell her that?!

18:45.700 --> 18:47.190
Huh? Was it something I shouldn't say?

18:47.190 --> 18:48.700
Jeez!

18:47.190 --> 18:49.810
Man, I'm so tired.

18:49.810 --> 18:52.150
Hunting iron golems one after another is tough!

18:52.150 --> 18:53.980
But didn't we make a lot of money?

18:53.980 --> 18:55.440
<i>These people...</i>

18:55.880 --> 18:58.770
<i>Red hair and all red equipment.</i>

18:58.770 --> 19:01.160
<i>A bull would definitely 
target him immediately.</i>

19:01.160 --> 19:02.120
<i>And...</i>

19:02.670 --> 19:04.580
<i>Blue! Green!</i>

19:04.950 --> 19:06.790
<i>Black! White!</i>

19:07.750 --> 19:09.460
<i>The five of them together...</i>

19:09.460 --> 19:11.500
<i>are Some-Kinda Rangers!</i>

19:13.370 --> 19:15.670
<i>Is it Sunday morning right now?</i>

19:16.130 --> 19:17.460
Hey, Jaden.

19:17.460 --> 19:21.130
When'd you start keeping a bear as a pet?

19:21.130 --> 19:22.090
<i>Urgh.</i>

19:23.130 --> 19:26.100
Seriously. What's with the bear girl?!

19:26.100 --> 19:27.090
She's cute.

19:27.090 --> 19:29.560
A bear should be sleeping 
in the forest, not an inn!

19:29.560 --> 19:33.150
<i>Right. With complete hostility, 
I shall name this group the Bozo Rangers.</i>

19:33.150 --> 19:36.150
Barbould, she's a talented adventurer.

19:36.150 --> 19:39.410
You're lying! This bear is an adventurer?!

19:39.410 --> 19:41.990
At least make it funny when you tell a joke!

19:41.990 --> 19:44.550
Her existence itself is pretty funny.

19:45.080 --> 19:46.550
True.

19:47.770 --> 19:49.330
Well, who cares about the bear?

19:49.330 --> 19:50.900
<i>I do!</i>

19:50.900 --> 19:52.540
<i>You wanna fight?!</i>

19:52.540 --> 19:55.190
How many did you manage today, Jaden?

19:55.190 --> 19:58.940
We managed to take down three iron golems!

19:58.940 --> 20:01.070
We also took down three of them.

20:01.070 --> 20:02.310
That so?

20:02.310 --> 20:06.670
But we'll be the ones who eliminate 
all the golems in the end.

20:06.670 --> 20:07.750
See ya.

20:09.790 --> 20:11.690
That was Barbould.

20:11.690 --> 20:16.490
They were also asked by the guild 
to hunt down the golems.

20:16.860 --> 20:19.440
His personality is a problem, 
but he's got skills.

20:20.740 --> 20:23.560
I can't believe they treated Yuna like a pet!

20:23.560 --> 20:26.110
She's definitely a mascot, not a pet!

20:26.110 --> 20:27.830
No, that's not right either.

20:30.280 --> 20:31.870
Today was so exhausting.

20:32.410 --> 20:35.640
I ran around Crimonia and the royal capital,

20:35.640 --> 20:38.420
took up a quest, and met the Bozo Rangers.

20:41.350 --> 20:44.570
<i>Well, it's fine. 
It's Mrs. Ellalaura, after all.</i>

20:44.570 --> 20:47.770
<i>I'm sure Fina is doing just fine.</i>

20:50.640 --> 20:53.100
What about this? Wouldn't it look good?

20:53.430 --> 20:55.190
What do you think, Surilina?

20:55.190 --> 20:57.970
Yes! I'm sure she would look wonderful.

20:57.970 --> 21:00.650
Mother! We should consider the current trends.

21:00.650 --> 21:02.600
This one would suit her better!

21:02.600 --> 21:04.460
Don't you think so, Surilina?

21:04.460 --> 21:07.120
Yes, that one is quite splendid as well!

21:07.120 --> 21:09.580
<i>Such expensive-looking clothes...</i>

21:09.580 --> 21:13.000
<i>If I got them dirty or ripped them...</i>

21:13.000 --> 21:14.960
<i>I couldn't afford to pay them back!</i>

21:15.460 --> 21:17.670
<i>If I wear those clothes,</i>

21:18.710 --> 21:22.330
<i>I'll stay inside without moving a muscle!</i>

21:22.330 --> 21:24.630
<i>I can't get them dirty!</i>

21:26.030 --> 21:27.590
Fina...

21:29.120 --> 21:32.100
Let's change clothes.

21:33.630 --> 21:38.190
<i>I'm in extreme danger right now!</i>

21:38.700 --> 21:42.300
<i>Save me, Yuna Sis!</i>

21:45.050 --> 21:46.350
What do you think?

21:46.350 --> 21:50.340
My! It looks so good on you! How cute!

21:50.340 --> 21:52.990
It's the fruit of all our labor!

21:52.990 --> 21:56.830
Well, then, we'll take you out 
in that dress tomorrow.

21:56.830 --> 21:57.500
Huh...?

21:59.140 --> 22:00.220
Huh?

22:01.790 --> 22:03.700
Huh?!

23:35.430 --> 23:40.010
<b>Bear, Becoming the Hero(?)</b>

23:35.470 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.620 --> 23:36.580
Bear?!
